              "attrs": {
                "id": "page-title"
              },
              "html": "Your first intimate audio experience together, without pressure."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "article-meta"
              },
              "html": "By Studio Mokuton · 24 October 2026"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "article-intro"
              },
              "html": "Curious about an intimate experience guided by a voice? This guide welcomes all adult couples, whatever each person’s gender or sexual orientation. From your first demo to choosing preferences, here are some practical ways to get started together."
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
