              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "article-meta",
                "style": "margin-top:24px;"
              },
              "html": "Free demos · No Caresse account · Personalized sessions with paid credits, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "article",
          "attrs": {
            "aria-labelledby": "page-title"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "1. Share the idea"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Choose a moment when you can talk without needing to start the experience immediately. Present it as something you are curious about sharing, rather than a problem in your relationship that needs fixing."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Describe what appeals to you: the voice, the surprise of a story or choosing an atmosphere together. A demo gives you a concrete feel for the format."
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "file": "blog-premiere-experience-audio-intime-couple.en/0118"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "2. Understand what you will hear"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Caresse offers guided fiction narrated by a synthetic voice. A demo is pregenerated audio with fixed names and preferences. It lets you discover the voice and tone without buying a session."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "During the demo, notice the voice, the pace and how much space the narration takes. Your impressions will help you choose the atmosphere of your own session."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "3. Agree on preferences before generation"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "To create a session, choose duo mode, names or nicknames and preferences you both enjoy. Every activity requires each person’s free, mutual consent throughout the experience. Consent can be withdrawn at any time; app settings do not replace it."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "To understand how this differs from a demo, see <a href=\"/en/personalized-intimate-audio/\">how intimate audio is personalized</a>. Generation uses your choices but does not guarantee every phrase or an exact duration."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "ul",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "\n<li>What tone appeals to you tonight: calm, romantic or more intense?</li>\n<li>Which suggestions do you want to leave out?</li>\n<li>Which names or nicknames would you like to hear in the narration?</li>\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "4. Set up your first listen"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "A <a href=\"/en/romantic-date-night-at-home/\">romantic date night at home</a> can begin with a conversation and a demo. A comfortable spot and a phone with a speaker are enough to discover the voice together."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "For a personalized session, check your setup and the displayed cost before generating it with a credit. Once the audio is ready, set the volume so everyone can hear the narration comfortably."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "5. Share your impressions"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "What did you enjoy: the voice, the pace, the atmosphere, the surprise? Comparing impressions helps you discover what you enjoy sharing."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "That conversation can inspire your next session: another atmosphere, a different intensity or new preferences chosen together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq",
            "aria-labelledby": "faq-title"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-inner"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "h2",
                  "attrs": {
                    "id": "faq-title"
                  },
                  "html": "Your questions, answered."
                },
                {
                  "type": "faq",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-list"
                  },
                  "prefix": "",
                  "suffix": "",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tag": "h3",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Do we need experience with intimate audio?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "No. A free demo lets you discover the voice, pace and style of narration before creating your own session."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tag": "h3",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Does agreeing before playback cover the whole session?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "No. Each person’s consent must be freely given and present throughout the experience, for every activity. It can be withdrawn at any time, regardless of the preferences selected in the app."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tag": "h3",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Is the first personalized session free?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Demos are free. A session created from your profiles uses a paid credit, with no subscription."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tag": "h3",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Do I need a Caresse account to buy credits?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "No. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse without creating a Caresse account. Purchases still require your Apple or Google account and its payment method on the store you use."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tag": "h3",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Which audio languages are available?"
                        },
                        {
                          "tag": "p",
                          "attrs": {},
                          "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. Demos are in French, English and Spanish. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
